flowchart TD
    A[Webcam Frame Captured] --> B[YOLOv8 Object Detection]
    B --> C{Object Detected?}
    C -- No --> A
    C -- Yes --> D[Distance Estimation Module]

    D --> D1[Known-size heuristic<br/>for person/door/chair etc.]
    D --> D2[MiDaS relative depth<br/>for unknown-size objects]
    D1 --> E[Assign Distance Band<br/>Red 3-5m / Green 5-10m / Blue 10m+]
    D2 --> E

    E --> F[Build Internal Object Cube<br/>class + size + position + distance]

    F --> G[Motion Tracking - ByteTrack]
    G --> H{Seen before in Memory Bank?}
    H -- Yes --> H1[Update existing entry<br/>distance, speed, position]
    H -- No --> H2[Create new memory entry]
    H1 --> I[Object Memory Bank]
    H2 --> I

    I --> J{Object distance > 30-40m?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Remove from Memory]
    J -- No --> L[Keep Active]

    L --> M[Egomotion Check<br/>Optical flow / feature displacement]
    M --> N{User moved significantly?}
    N -- Yes --> O[Trigger Re-scan Prompt<br/>Wipe stale memory]
    N -- No --> P[Continue with current memory]

    O --> Q[Voice: Ask user to look around]
    P --> R[Decision Logic Layer]

    R --> S{Object in user's path<br/>OR within Red zone<br/>OR moving toward user?}
    S -- Yes --> T[Speak Alert<br/>e.g. 'person, 3 meters, ahead']
    S -- No --> U[Stay Silent<br/>internal state only]

    T --> A
    U --> A

    V[User asks 'which way?'] -.-> W[Path/Curve Detection]
    W -.-> X[Speak Direction Guidance]
